      "location": "答54二阶导数，英文印795",
      "original": "\\sum(c_1+\\cdots+c_n)^2=[z^n]",
      "final": "\\sum(c_1+\\cdots+c_n)(c_1+\\cdots+c_n-1)=[z^n]",
      "basis": "两源同印平方。对权重x^X二次求导后在x=1得X(X−1)，闭式是下降阶乘矩。n=2，两树X为0,1，平方和为1，原闭式为0；逐棵核n=1–10。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 667,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "d96d49d77480448a6035b38fdae43ba15f2dfccba8b9627cff6bdde16c97568e"
    },
