      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 682,
      "location": "答54方差，英文印795",
      "original": "(\\frac56-\\frac\\pi4)n^{3/2}+O(n)",
      "final": "(\\frac56-\\frac\\pi4)n^3+O(n^2)",
      "basis": "按已对源的两导数闭式，设A=4^n/C_n、b=(3n+1)/2、P=(5n²+19n+6)(n+1)/6，精确方差为P−b−b²−A²/4。代入卡塔兰渐近式即得立方主项和二次余项。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 667,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "d96d49d77480448a6035b38fdae43ba15f2dfccba8b9627cff6bdde16c97568e"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-682-57-binomial-factor",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 682,
      "location": "答57中段，英文印796",
      "original": "S_p(a,b-1)（递推右边）",
      "final": "2b(2b-1)S_p(a,b-1)",
      "basis": "双语原式漏乘整系数。逐项由(b²−k²)·binom(2b,b−k)=2b(2b−1)·binom(2b−2,b−k−1)；a=b=1,p=0原左右4与2，修订后相等。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 667,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "d96d49d77480448a6035b38fdae43ba15f2dfccba8b9627cff6bdde16c97568e"
    },
